  "term": "aggressiveness",
  "definition": "Aggressiveness is the degree to which a tumor shows more serious disease behavior and is used in risk assessment to sort patients into lower or higher risk groups. In this packet, it refers to prostate cancer severity as estimated from Gleason score and molecular patterns.",
